{{!-- META {"path":"forms","title":"Forms","description":"Define a form once, embed it anywhere by its id. The platform renders the fields, validates them, filters spam, keeps every submission in an inbox and mails it on, and on a translated page it picks the matching translated form.","parent":"showcase","order":16,"data":{"icon":"textbox","preset":"interference"}} --}}
{{> page-hero parent=page.parent}}

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.1fr] lg:items-start">
    <div data-sw-animation="fade-up">
      <p class="ws-index ws-ink">01 · One helper</p>
      <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="fm1_title">A whole form from its id.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="fm1_lead">A form is a content entry of its own: fields, labels, the success and error messages, where submissions go and which spam checks apply. The helper renders all of it, with the honeypot and the submit wiring added for you. The date field here is the date picker.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6 sm:p-8">
      {{#if forms.sc_demo}}

{{sw-form "sc_demo" class="grid gap-4"}}

      {{else}}
      <div class="grid gap-4" aria-hidden="true">
        <label class="block"><span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Your name</span><input type="text" class="w-full" placeholder="Ada Lovelace" disabled /></label>
        <label class="block"><span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Email</span><input type="text" class="w-full" placeholder="you@example.com" disabled /></label>
        <label class="block"><span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Preferred call date</span><input type="text" class="w-full" placeholder="Select a date" disabled /></label>
        <label class="block"><span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Message</span><textarea class="w-full" rows="3" disabled></textarea></label>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary w-fit" disabled>Send</button>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-base-content/60">A preview of the demo form's fields. Sending is switched off on this copy.</p>
      {{/if}}
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-6">
<div class="ws-window overflow-hidden rounded-2xl">
  <div class="ws-dots flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-3"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="ml-3 font-code text-xs text-white/50">forms · helper</span></div>
<pre class="overflow-x-auto"><code><span class="tk-hb">\{{sw-form "sc_demo" class="grid gap-4"}}</span></code></pre>
</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-y border-base-content/10 bg-base-200/50">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
      <p class="ws-index ws-ink">02 · Your own markup</p>
      <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="fm2_title">Your layout, the platform's plumbing.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="fm2_lead">Write the fields yourself and mark the form with <code class="font-code text-base">data-sw-form</code>. At render the platform adds what you leave out: the submit wiring, the honeypot, the captcha when the form asks for one, and the success and error messages from the definition. Field names must match the definition, which also decides what is required.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start">
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6 sm:p-8">
        {{#if forms.sc_demo}}

<form data-sw-form="sc_demo" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
  <label class="block"><span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Your name</span><input type="text" name="name" required class="w-full" /></label>
  <label class="block"><span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Email</span><input type="email" name="email" required class="w-full" /></label>
  <label class="block sm:col-span-2"><span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Topic</span>
    <select name="topic" required class="select w-full">
      <option>A question about Sitewright</option>
      <option>A bug report</option>
      <option>Something else</option>
    </select>
  </label>
  <label class="block sm:col-span-2"><span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Message</span><textarea name="message" rows="4" required class="w-full"></textarea></label>
  <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary sm:col-span-2">Send it</button>
</form>

        {{else}}
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2" aria-hidden="true">
          <label class="block"><span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Your name</span><input type="text" class="w-full" disabled /></label>
          <label class="block"><span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Email</span><input type="text" class="w-full" disabled /></label>
          <label class="block sm:col-span-2"><span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Message</span><textarea rows="3" class="w-full" disabled></textarea></label>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary sm:col-span-2" disabled>Send it</button>
        </div>
        {{/if}}
      </div>
      <div class="min-w-0">
<div class="ws-window overflow-hidden rounded-2xl">
  <div class="ws-dots flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-3"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="ml-3 font-code text-xs text-white/50">forms · own markup</span></div>
