</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-3xl" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
    <p class="ws-index ws-ink">03 · Fields</p>
    <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl" data-sw-text="fm3_title">Twelve field types.</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="fm3_lead">Up to 50 fields per form. The server checks required fields, email and URL formats, numbers and the allowed options again on submit. Submissions are stored as text only: there is no file upload field.</p>
  </div>
  <ul class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 list-none gap-3 p-0 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6">
    <li class="rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-4"><p class="font-code text-sm font-semibold ws-ink">text</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-base-content/60">One line</p></li>
    <li class="rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-4"><p class="font-code text-sm font-semibold ws-ink">email</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-base-content/60">Checked format</p></li>
    <li class="rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-4"><p class="font-code text-sm font-semibold ws-ink">tel</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-base-content/60">Phone number</p></li>
    <li class="rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-4"><p class="font-code text-sm font-semibold ws-ink">url</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-base-content/60">http or https</p></li>
    <li class="rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-4"><p class="font-code text-sm font-semibold ws-ink">number</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-base-content/60">Decimal only</p></li>
    <li class="rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-4"><p class="font-code text-sm font-semibold ws-ink">textarea</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-base-content/60">Several lines</p></li>
    <li class="rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-4"><p class="font-code text-sm font-semibold ws-ink">select</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-base-content/60">One of a list</p></li>
    <li class="rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-4"><p class="font-code text-sm font-semibold ws-ink">radio</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-base-content/60">One of a group</p></li>
    <li class="rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-4"><p class="font-code text-sm font-semibold ws-ink">checkbox</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-base-content/60">Yes or no, or several</p></li>
    <li class="rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-4"><p class="font-code text-sm font-semibold ws-ink">date</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-base-content/60">The date picker</p></li>
    <li class="rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-4"><p class="font-code text-sm font-semibold ws-ink">time</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-base-content/60">The time slider</p></li>
    <li class="rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-4"><p class="font-code text-sm font-semibold ws-ink">datetime</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-base-content/60">Both at once</p></li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="border-y border-base-content/10 bg-base-200/50">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
        {{sw-icon "shield-check" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-heading text-lg font-bold">Spam stays out</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">Every form gets a honeypot, a time trap, a check for any human input and a rate limit. Per form you can add proof of work, which costs each visitor a moment of CPU, or a captcha: hCaptcha, reCAPTCHA v2 or v3, set up once per project. Filtered attempts are counted, not stored.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="80">
        {{sw-icon "tray" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-heading text-lg font-bold">Where it goes</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">To the project's inbox and on by email, through the instance's mail server or the project's own SMTP. Or to the <code class="font-code">contact.php</code> mailer that ships with an exported site, to your own third-party endpoint, or composed into a WhatsApp message on the visitor's phone.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="160">
        {{sw-icon "translate" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-heading text-lg font-bold">Per language</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">On a German page, <code class="font-code">sc_demo</code> resolves to <code class="font-code">sc_demo-de</code> when that form exists, so translated pages share the page code and each language keeps its own labels and messages.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">Without JavaScript a platform form does not submit: it has no action attribute by design, because submission runs through the spam checks in the browser. Never write the endpoint or the form component marker yourself; both are added at render.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-t border-base-content/10 bg-base-200/50">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
      <h2 class="ws-display text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">More of the showcase</h2>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="{{sw-url '/showcase'}}">All demos {{sw-icon "arrow-right" "h-4 w-4"}}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {{#each pages.showcase._attributes.children}}
      {{#unless (eq path @root.page.path)}}
      <a class="ws-tile rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-4" href="{{sw-url path}}">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-heading font-semibold">{{#if data.icon}}{{sw-icon data.icon "h-4 w-4 ws-ink"}}{{/if}}{{title}}</span>
      </a>
      {{/unless}}
      {{/each}}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
